april.description:
Defaults to last year (i.e., last 12 months). Click the filter to change to last month or quarter.
To customize the time period: 
1) Click the filter, under "Range type", select "Advanced";
2) Enter start and end dates like "Jan 12, 2024" or "01/12/2024";
3) Click the "Apply" button in the bottom right;
4) Click the "Apply filters" button at the bottom of the filter bar.

later.description:
This filter controls how the time is displayed. Defaults to last year (i.e., last 12 months). 

To customize the time period: 
1) Click the filter, under "Range type", select "Custom";
2) Enter start and end dates like "Jan 12, 2024" or "01/12/2024";
3) Change the interval from "Months before" to "Quarters before" or "Years before" based on your Time Unit
3) Click the "Apply" button in the bottom right;
4) Then, at the bottom of your screen, click the "Apply filters" button to refresh the dashboard.

